func (s *APIV1Service) resolveSSOIdentity(ctx context.Context, idpName, code, redirectURI, codeVerifier string) (*storepb.IdentityProvider, *idp.IdentityProviderUserInfo, error) {
```

## Concrete protocol implementation that ships

**Path:** `/bench/repo/internal/idp/oauth2`  
**Module import:** `github.com/usememos/memos/internal/idp/oauth2`

This is the only protocol subpackage under `internal/idp` (no SAML, OIDC-only, etc.). It implements OAuth2:

```1:2:/bench/repo/internal/idp/oauth2/oauth2.go
